--- !u!114 &427263328
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 427263325}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6b40beeb965e5d9419bf817d6f7d59bb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  go_to_next_node: 1
  executed_from_load: 0
  actor_name_from: 0
  actor: 
  speaker_name_from: 0
  textbox_title: 
  fetch_localized_stat_value: 0
  dialogue_from: 0
  localized_key: 
  text: The memories are yours now- the good and the horrific. The emotions are yours
    to feel- the joy and grief. It's overwhelming, like learnig to use a muscle you
    never knew you had.You are whole, and being whole is messy and painful and beautiful.
    The cure is the realization that there is no "cure" in the sense of a before
    and after. There is only a before and an after you. A singular, continuous, unbroken
    you, finally weaving a single story out of a thousand shattered pieces, You are,
    for the first time, the only one living your life.
  talking_beeps: {fileID: 0}
  darken_all_other_characters: 1
  bring_speaker_to_front: 1
  clear_text_after: 0
  log_text: 1
  log_category: Default
  done_printing: 0
  no_voice_playing: 0
  done_voice_clip: 0
