  localized_key: 
  text: '"Oh," he whispers into your hair. "I''m so sorry I didn''t see it before."
    There''s a new smell in the house- lemony cleaner instead of old beer cans. Dad''s
    wearing his work shirts again, the ones with his name stitched on the pocket.
    He sits with you at breakfast now, actually listening when you talk about the
    "others" in your head.'
  talking_beeps: {fileID: 0}
  darken_all_other_characters: 1
